rds. Expose a supported production input/storage/read path, not a test-only oracle or fabricated storage path. Test missing/changed record, same-record facts and substitution. No claim of local attestation, compatibility or missing dependency authorizes a different object identity.\n6|2. Implement real complete authority union and deterministic greatest(epoch,lease_id) winner, retaining losing histories. A lagging epoch1 replica beside epoch2 local is valid and must allow fresh BuildPlan; equality of every copy is wrong. Bind all actual lease/event/tombstone heads used, validate unreadable/parked/corrupt observations without treating unknown as absence, preserve explicit provenance and no name retargeting. Keep cross-source immutable-record conflict/refusal tests.\n7|3. Complete authoritative summaries: required workspace_status, validated CapabilitySummary values, warnings, process_present boolean for status and owner_host_name1..64. Unknown required observations MUST refuse selector_observation_unavailable; established absence/empty capabilities is distinct and can be valid. Use real validated facts through supported APIs; refuse whole mixed lists when any row is unrepresentable. Preserve bootstrap, host-metadata and checkpoint timestamp refusals and diagnostic low-level access.\n8|4. Repair and truthfully classify narrowing evidence. Reviewer N-record-nonempty SURVIVED; add meaningful validated changed-record evidence or prove exact downstream subsumption without claiming unauthorized acceptance from the survivor alone. Preserve same-instrument SURVIVED control, named behavioral KILLED evidence and exact tested source snapshots/digests. Counts must be rederived from final manifest (prior manifest35N+3B=38, not claimed33N+3B). Fix all outcome/README/TRACEABILITY semantic and completion claims. A later error-reason change proves ordering only, not all record admission.\n9|\n10|Use existing canonical validators and reducer rules rather than inventing duplicate authority. Do not stop with partial API or defer shared required fields to CLI. CLI rendering/invocation and durable recovery remain caller-owned. Do not relitigate unaffected selector/predecessor closed findings. Use canonical /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board and main-checkout Curator Go skill. No direct board edits, destructive Git, manual managed candidate commits, hosted CI or synthetic evidence. Preserve complete raw regression/control/mutation evidence under task scratch and attach durable artifacts. Run delta-appropriate tests and required final gates with actual exit codes, then normal handoff for independent Astra medium review.","final_result":true}}}
