test their validity. Cover positive valid successor, self/cycles/wrong epoch and missing/wrong-session/wrong-predecessor checkpoint facts. Review actual normative schema before implementing, do not invent a checkpoint rule or weaken it because future checkpoint persistence tasks exist. Establish a real shared admission boundary within current scope; keep unrelated CLI/durable recovery owners separate.\n8|2. Required parked same-session authority is UNKNOWN/incomplete, not absence. Build and Revalidate must fail closed with proper integrity/read class. Replace the positive TestRevalidateUnionParkedCopyIgnored expectation. Exercise reviewer production crash-hook fixture with conflicting same UUID and missing index. Preserve raw diagnostic inspection, genuinely absent source/session behavior and valid lagging copies.\n9|3. Closed capability names: authoritative registry is seven provider names native_resume, portable_store, managed_pty, appserver, task_board_primary, prompt_spawn, native_goal_binding. Use existing authoritative registry/ownership rather than a new divergent list. Reject invented names at Status and List, cover every admitted name, replace exec/net positive fixtures, retain empty nonnil vs unavailable distinction.\n10|\n11|Do not relitigate closed evidence: actual canonical digest/created_at substitution refusal; unknown required observations and host64 bound; existing divergence/tombstone/unreadable peer; earlier predecessor crash/reducer/enum work. Reviewer now proved changed LIVE nonempty record guard subsumption by heads/index using CreateSession/AppendEvent and Reader.Local swap. Preserve that source/test and explicit limitation; do not repeatedly mutate refusal ordering or claim the parked fixture proves live-record behavior.\n12|\n13|Evidence: previous40N+3B logs are pre-wrapper equivalent, not exactCR4 source. Deliver exact-current-source meaningful mutant evidence for new gates, actual same-instrument harmless SURVIVED and named KILLED controls