{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":5,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\"}}\\n\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":6,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — a\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":7,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\"}}\\n\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":8,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":9,\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\"}}\\n\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":15,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implementation matches AC\\\"}}\\n\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":16,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\"}}\\n\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-21gygk\\\",\\\"item\\\":17,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Tests green\\\"}}\\n\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2359,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 590,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
